  SELF-TEST OK argv=ok empty-fail=true good-verdict=pass

nbb ~/.gftd/shinshi-catalog-video/quality.cljs --self-test        # deployed short name
  SELF-TEST OK argv=ok empty-fail=true good-verdict=pass

nbb ~/.gftd/shinshi-catalog-video/quality.cljs <candidate> --json  # exact loop invocation
  verdict=pass luma=137.64 motion=6.62

nbb ~/.gftd/shinshi-catalog-video/quality.cljs /tmp/aoi-amano-cafe-0.mp4
  VERDICT pass  LUMA 135.14
```

Both directions checked: empty mp4 still fails, known-good clip still passes,
and the deployed path now answers instead of probing itself.

